## API wiring (landing → PWA)

- Newsletter signup: `POST https://pwa-signal-plus-v2.onrender.com/api/newsletter/subscribe` with `{ email, source: "landing" }` — **404 today; implement in PWA repo**
- App login link: `POST /api/auth/request` — **works**
- GLP-1 news feed: `GET /api/glp1-feed` — used by landing build

## CMS (PWA only)

- Weekly newsletter compose: `/cms/emails/weekly`
- Contacts / CMS: `/cms`

## Agent access blocker

Cloud agents can edit **this landing repo** only. The PWA repo must be **created or pushed to GitHub** and the agent granted access before backend work (newsletter subscribe API, CMS integration) can ship from here.

Push to `main` on this repo deploys the landing site live.
